# scripts/build-local.sh output — the three-binary local-first layout
# (local-first-init-funnel Task 4/5/6, final-review I1): /archistrator (CLI),
# /archistrator-server (composition root, -tags localdist), /aiarch-state-mcp
# (construct-verb rig). webappdist/ is the staged webApp/dist tree go:embed
# needs at compile time (cmd/server/spa_embed.go). All build-time artifacts,
# never committed.
server/cmd/server/webappdist/
/archistrator
/archistrator-server
/aiarch-state-mcp

# local research material (e.g. the Righting Software book) — not committed.
# Anchored to the repo root: .aiarch/state/research/ is committed project state (F42 corpus files).
/research/
.mcp-pilot/

# Method .claude assets are materialized from the method-assets lib (pinned in
# server/go.mod), never vendored — run `make claude-assets`. Only app-local files
# (.claude/settings.json, .claude/skills/grillme) stay committed.
/.claude/agents/
/.claude/commands/
/.claude/skills/the-method*/
/.claude/method-assets/
/.claude/.method-assets-manifest.json

# Scratch/brainstorm output from the superpowers skill set — working notes, not
# committed artifacts (nearly swept into a commit once).
.superpowers/brainstorm/

# SP1 capture-seam episodeAccess sidecar store (server/internal/resourceaccess/
# episode/episodeaccess.go). The store directory writes its own self-ignoring
# .aiarch/traces/.gitignore ("*\n") in every OPERATED repo, so this dogfood
# entry is only needed here, in archistrator's own repo.
/.aiarch/traces/
